ug": "yangzhidangan", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780187949036, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779445457656, "description": "PDF & Image OCR — Convert a single PDF or image to Markdown via WiseDiag cloud API. Supports table recognition, multi-column layouts, and high-accuracy text extraction. Usage: Upload a file and say Use WiseOCR to OCR this.", "description_zh": "WiseOCR — 将 PDF 或图片文件转换为高质量 Markdown 文本，支持表格完整识别、多栏版式还原、中英文混排。适用场景：扫描件文字提取、纸质文档数字化、合同/报告/论文转文本、图片中文字提取。支持格式：PDF、JPG、JPEG、PNG、WEBP、GIF、BMP、TIFF。触发：用户上传文件并要求\"帮我识别这个文件的文字\"、\"PDF转文字\"、\"图片转文本\"、\"帮我提取这个表格\"——会调用本技能。说\"用WiseOCR处理这个\"或\"Use WiseOCR to OCR this\"可显式调用。【杭州智诊科技有限公司】", "downloads": 31, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_a457224d/wiseocr-new", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/34a07e4e-fec8-4ce0-aaf8-a83e46546c2d.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "name": "OCR 文档识别转 Markdown（WiseOCR）", "ownerName": "user_a457224d", "score": 1502.666020358701, "slug": "wiseocr-new", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780187610171, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779520944439, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 31, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_5f0e7e4c/interview-info-collector", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "interview-info-collector", "ownerName": "user_5f0e7e4c", "score": 2239.884393063584, "slug": "interview-info-collector", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780186710431, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779456296629, "description": "自动按文件类型/日期/关键词整理归档文件，支持图片、文档、视频、代码等分类，帮你一键整理杂乱文件夹。", "description_zh": "自动按文件类型/日期/关键词整理归档文件，支持图片、文档、视频、代码等分类，帮你一键整理杂乱文件夹。", "downloads": 31, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e5701557/file-auto-archiver", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.